  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> are in <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>7</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>16</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>114</mn></math> , then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>6</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>16</mn></msub></math> is equal to :",
